&reftitle.description;
&style.oop;
public DateTimeDateTime::add DateIntervalinterval
&style.procedural;
DateTimedate_add DateTimeobject DateIntervalinterval
Adds the specified DateInterval object to the specified DateTime object.
Like DateTimeImmutable::add but works with DateTime.
The procedural version takes the DateTime object as its first argument.

&reftitle.changelog;





    &Version;
    &Description;





    8.3.0

     A DateObjectError is now thrown for an
     object that has not been correctly initialized. Previously, an
     Error was thrown.
